            "title": "A.C.E. Tubing",
            "text": "<p>Painstakingly crafted from our proprietary heat-treated, air-hardened, and custom-extruded A.C.E. steel tubing, there’s nothing else like it on Earth. <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260116182929/https://allcitycycles.com/design/ace-steel-tubing\">Learn more about A.C.E. Tubing</a></p>",
