            "title": "WHISKY NO.9 CX Disc 12 Tapered Fork",
            "text": "<p>Lightweight with generous tire clearance and precise handling capabilities, Whisky’s gorgeous carbon fork accommodates 12mm thru-axles and flat-mount disc brakes.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_z3pNzq": {
