            "title": "Tire Clearance",
            "text": "<p>Built with versatility in mind, it accommodates tire sizes 700 x 42mm or 650b x 47mm (both with or without fenders).</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_Q8wRck": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/all-city-cosmic-stallion-GRX-ace-tubing_68d620f0-f73b-4a1f-8988-3bcc99fa803d.jpg",
            "title": "Di2 Routing Options",
            "text": "<p>Outfitted to make your dreams of accurate and effortless electronic shifting a hassle-free reality.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_RG4LKC": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/all-city-cosmic-stallion-GRX-ace-tubing_68d620f0-f73b-4a1f-8988-3bcc99fa803d.jpg",
